  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Children&#x2019;s rights - Myanmar</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Focus on the monitoring of child rights including improving state capacity to monitor and report to the UN Committe on the Rights of the Child; strengthening of national systems and building awareness and capacity of civil society to promote and defend child rights. Other partners: Cambodian Children and Youth Movement for Children Rights (CCYMCR), Kainayar Rual Social Development Orgnization (KRSDO), National Child Rights Working Group (NCRWG). Since the coup d&apos;&#xE9;tat in 2021, major changes have been made to the programme approach to include displaced children in IDP camps.</narrative>
  </description>
